  "description": "The sweetest tip to become a Grade 7 civil servant without exams! Get recruited by the National Intelligence Service during military service through recommendation..! So I ended up sitting at home in Dandong, China, the world's powder keg, assigned to monitor the Yalu River Bridge. But starting with that 5 million won night shift, major incidents involving multiple countries kept getting tangled up with me.\n\nSigh, I just want to make money without working... Huh? But wait, the mission actually got completed luckier than I thought?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
